            "Realist resistance: The realist can reply that emotions may track moral facts rather than constitute them, so the debate cannot be ended by renaming the vocabulary.",
            "Practical remainder: Even without objective moral facts, humans still need ways to condemn cruelty, negotiate norms, design law, and explain why some reactions deserve correction.",
